    "author": "AppPress",
    "description": "Visual automation engine for AppPress \u2014 trigger \u2192 conditions \u2192 actions. When X happens, do Y. Supports 19 built-in triggers, 17 built-in actions (including AI prompt/response, round-robin assignment, field transforms, and generic outbound HTTP requests), HMAC-signed webhook ingress, approval gates, delayed steps, conditional branching, formula evaluation, version snapshots with rollback, multi-site scoping, and rate-limiting circuit breakers. Implements StandardContracts::WORKFLOWS so any App Pack can resolve the workflow service without a direct dependency.",
